## 6) تحقق على الجهاز

```sh
ls -l /dev/fb0
cat /proc/fb                              # 0 simpledrmdrmfb  (أو VESA VGA)
cat /sys/class/graphics/fb0/virtual_size   # 800,600
cat /sys/class/graphics/fb0/bits_per_pixel # 16
fbset -i
afree -m ; dmesg | grep -iE 'fb0|simpledrm|vesa|Console'
```

